# A reply sent while the session is working is queued, and the user can see and take
# it back. The "Queued" notice carries a Cancel button: tapping it drops the reply and
# the notice says so, and the turn ending delivers nothing. /queue lists what is
# waiting. When a queued reply does go in, its notice turns into "Delivered".

size 110x30
arg --mux
fake_telegram private
session existing-app Existing app session
# The stub bot's long poll returns every ten seconds; taps ride on that.
timeout 40000

wait_for Existing app session
press enter
wait_for Fake Copilot is idling

# A first turn, so the phone has a message of this session's to reply to.
type e2e:work 1500 Setup is done.
press enter
press ctrl+b d
wait_for Existing app session
telegram_wait Setup is done.

# A long turn. A reply during it is queued, and the notice has a Cancel under it.
press enter
type e2e:work 14000 First long task finished.
press enter
press ctrl+b d
wait_for Existing app session
telegram_say Stop, do the other thing instead
telegram_wait Queued
telegram_dump 01-queued
telegram_wait button on

# Tapping Cancel takes the reply back; the notice becomes "Cancelled".
telegram_tap Cancel
telegram_wait answered tap: Cancelled
telegram_wait Cancelled: your reply
telegram_dump 02-cancelled

# The turn ends with nothing to deliver: the cancelled words never reach the session.
wait 14000
press enter
wait_for First long task finished
expect_not Fake Copilot received: Stop, do the other thing
dump 03-session-untouched

# Another long turn and another queued reply. /queue, sent bare, lists it with its
# own Cancel; the turn ending delivers it and the notice turns into "Delivered".
type e2e:work 10000 Second long task finished.
press enter
press ctrl+b d
wait_for Existing app session
telegram_say Then write the summary
telegram_wait Queued
telegram_say_bare /queue
telegram_wait Waiting to be delivered
telegram_wait Then write the summary
telegram_wait button on
telegram_dump 04-listing
wait 10000
press enter
wait_for Fake Copilot received: Then write the summary
press ctrl+b d
wait_for Existing app session
telegram_wait Delivered to Existing app session
telegram_dump 05-delivered
dump 05-list
